# Zhuxin, Beacon of Spirits

> Zhuxin is a zone-control mage who wins teamfights by stretching them into channeled 4-second windows that most mid laners physically cannot survive. She rewards patience, punishes impatient teammates, and collapses against any draft that can close 4 meters on her while she's holding a button down. Knowing which bucket your current game is in decides whether you should lock her.

