## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.95 on 2026-08-18. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Mid Control Default (Mid)

- Items: Demon Boots, Clock of Destiny, Ice Queen Wand, Glowing Wand, Wishing Lantern, Divine Glaive
- Core: Clock of Destiny, Ice Queen Wand, Wishing Lantern
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Agility, Bargain Hunter, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Magic Boots over Demon Boots when Use when lane control is stable enough that cooldown tempo matters more than extra mana recovery.; Genius Wand over Glowing Wand when Use when your team has multiple magic damage sources and stacked Magic Defense reduction beats anti-sustain burn.; Blood Wings over Divine Glaive when Use when enemies are not buying heavy Magic Defense and the last slot needs shielded repositioning instead of penetration.
- Total cost: 11060 gold

Default ranked mid build for mana stability, slow stacking, repeated Soul Snare captures, and late penetration into front-to-back fights.

### Frontline Lantern Damage (Mid)

- Items: Demon Boots, Clock of Destiny, Glowing Wand, Ice Queen Wand, Wishing Lantern, Holy Crystal
- Core: Clock of Destiny, Glowing Wand, Wishing Lantern
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Agility, Bargain Hunter, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Sprint
- Flex: Divine Glaive over Holy Crystal when Use when enemy frontliners have enough Magic Defense that raw Magic Power no longer converts into real damage.; Genius Wand over Holy Crystal when Use when low-to-mid Magic Defense targets are being hit repeatedly by Lantern Flare and allied magic damage.; Winter Crown over Holy Crystal when Use when Zhuxin can carry the fight only if she survives one committed dive after the control core is online.
- Total cost: 12090 gold

Damage-forward setup for durable enemy drafts that must walk through repeated burn, slow, Soul Snare stacking, and Wishing Lantern triggers.

### Anti-Dive Utility (Mid)

- Items: Tough Boots, Clock of Destiny, Glowing Wand, Brute Force Breastplate, Winter Crown, Divine Glaive
- Core: Clock of Destiny, Glowing Wand, Brute Force Breastplate
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Impure Rage
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Ice Queen Wand over Brute Force Breastplate when Use when melee divers can be kited and extra slow control is worth more than physical durability.; Athena's Shield over Brute Force Breastplate when Use against magic burst that can force Zhuxin out before Lantern Flare stacks enough Soul Snare.; Immortality over Divine Glaive when Use when late fights are decided by surviving the first pick attempt rather than piercing a tank line.
- Total cost: 10530 gold

Defensive utility build for assassin, chain-control, or hard-engage games where Zhuxin must live through the first commit before controlling the fight.

